{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"aea211ce038d7a2e","type":"text","text":"[[Bio Labs.canvas]]\n#Volstarian_Dynasty ","x":-480,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"bac164ffa7dd07ab","type":"text","text":"Just past the main entrance doors lies a large dark room with all different kinds of plant life mostly dead but some somehow still alive. It isnt a very large chamber. A walk way that reaches beyond site down the middle with dead potted plants on the left and right of it. ","x":-482,"y":-180,"width":505,"height":150},
		{"id":"bd6411b469dba982","type":"text","text":"Left side:\n\nOn the left side of the room there is a series of still living plant life trapped in glass casing that follow you as you approach. Most of which seem violent to light and strike at the glass screeching and spitting a green acid at the glass which is unaffected. One of the plants is labelled Vintras.\n\nVintras has the head of a human with it at growing from it a red flower that blooms into a bony maw with two human like eyes that begins to cackle with laughter as you approach it. \n","x":-482,"y":20,"width":725,"height":257},
		{"id":"4dab07797c026dd8","type":"file","file":"Volstarian Dynasty/Armount/Images/Pasted image 20260915182033.png","x":-482,"y":300,"width":712,"height":460},
		{"id":"7b611dea88aa3148","type":"text","text":"Right Side:\n\nA wall of glass that travels all the way to the end of the chamber, on the other side of the glass is an aquarium of plant life. Within the water are all different types of plants ranging from seaweed to corals. However it is very hard to miss the creature that lives within feeding on the plant life which never seems to stop growing. A glowing marker on its body 00459.\n\nA human hand with skin stappled between its fingers to create a flipper at the wrist a smiling mouth with no eyes and as you approach it begins to violently cackle and laugh.\n","x":380,"y":16,"width":797,"height":261},
		{"id":"fc5c7400b4b89b63","type":"file","file":"Volstarian Dynasty/Armount/Images/Pasted image 20260915182059.png","x":379,"y":321,"width":841,"height":439},
		{"id":"dc5acefe0030a3da","type":"text","text":"At the very end of the Green Room there is a hallway that leads to a staircase that descends several kilometers underground. At the bottom of the staircase there is a door way labelled The Decontamination Grid. The door way is open and you can see another open door 15 feet across the way. As you step onto the ground level you can see a gas beginning to form behind you approaching quicker and quicker with every passing second. \n","x":0,"y":820,"width":618,"height":170}
	],
	"edges":[]
}